# Panel API

Two route layers (both stay for now):

| Layer | Prefix | Used by |
|-------|--------|---------|
| Legacy 3x-ui | `panel/api/server/*` | `index.html`, `xray.html` dashboard |
| Native WDTT | `panel/api/*` | `users.html`, `connections.html`, `settings.html` |

Shared logic: `panel/api_ops.go` (`controlService`, `updateGeofilesOp`, `fetchServiceLogLines`, …).

When changing behavior, update **one** implementation in api_ops / paneldb; keep legacy response format (`jsonMsg`, raw array) in `server_handlers.go` wrappers.

Frontend: dashboard uses `HttpUtil` + `/panel/api/server/…`; new pages use `panel/api/…`.
